Adds 7 new sidebar sections without altering any existing functionality:

1. OSINT Tools (12 tools): Domain/IP/Email/GitHub/CEP/Phone/URL-Threat/
   Username/Headers/DNS/CertTransparency/Wayback. All deterministic
   (regex+HTTP) — IA only optional on the result panel.
2. Central de Agentes IA (16 agents): OSINT Web/Network/DNS-Recon/
   Shodan + SOCMINT Redes/Username/Dark Web + FININT Fiscal-BR/Cripto/
   COAF + Metadata EXIF/Email/Doc + Breach + Geo-OSINT + Maltego.
   Each card shows its stack (regex+http / http+key / client-side /
   backend-only / rule+ai / graph-traversal) — hybrid arch transparent.
3. Radar Societário ABDCRIM: CNPJ/CPF/name/address lookup with live
   BrasilAPI integration. Three-tier classification (Confirmado /
   Provável / Indiciário) and four-tier link strength (Forte/Médio/
   Fraco/Indeterminado). Local relational graph + cross-source
   suggestions (Casa dos Dados, Jusbrasil, INPI, Portal Transparência).
4. Transparência Pública (12 endpoints): CEIS/CNEP/CEPIM/Servidores/
   Contratos/Licitações/Bolsa Família/BPC/Despesas/Emendas/Viagens/
   PEPs. Shows curl examples; real calls go via backend proxy.
5. API Explorer: 49 cataloged APIs with category filter, CORS status
   and auth requirement.
6. ISO & Legislação: 73 ISO/IEC norms + 23 Brazilian legal instruments,
   searchable and category-filterable.
7. TACER + ACH extension: workspace tab "Plano de Coleta" now shows
   5-phase TACER framework with checklist per phase. "Achados" tab
   adds full ACH (Analysis of Competing Hypotheses) matrix —
   click cells to cycle N→C→I→N, automatic inconsistency scoring.

Branding: FORSETI Technologies ® CNPJ 66.603.219/0001-93, approved by
Academia Brasileira de Direito Criminal ABDCRIM ® CNPJ 55.739.503/0001-75.
Reflected in title, header badge, and console banner.

Architecture principle (explicit in code comments and UI alerts):
deterministic algorithms first (regex/HTTP/parsing), light AI only for
triage, premium LLM only on noble layers — never sending raw payloads.

30/30 integration checks pass. JS syntax validated.

