 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=A1rio=20Oficial=20integration=20=E2=80=94=20v3.1?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Three targeted enhancements, with zero changes to other modules:

CLIENTS — Perfil 360° (10 tabs in detail modal):
- Visão Geral with 4 KPI cards.
- Biografia (free-text + auto-draft generator from structured data).
- Histórico Político: candidaturas + cargos públicos (TSE/Transparência
  links). Manual entry with prompt flow.
- Bens Declarados: tipo/descrição/valor/ano/fonte with running total.
- Empresas Vinculadas: manual links + one-click integration with
  Radar Societário.
- Processos: tabela completa with "Abrir" button.
- Documentos: archive PDF/images/Word into cofre with SHA-256, kind
  classification (Procuração/RG/CPF/Contrato/etc).
- Notícias: manual entry + pre-built Google News/Jusbrasil/Blogs
  search links.
- Links Públicos: 10+ deterministic links per client type (TSE, OAB,
  Transparência, Receita, INPI, LinkedIn, etc).
- OSINT: one-click creation of OSINT investigation pre-bound to client.

PROCESSES — full detail with 6 tabs including Andamentos:
- New collection: processMovements with 13 movement types
  (peticao_inicial, despacho, decisão, sentença, audiência, intimação,
  manifestação, recurso, contestação, juntada, trânsito, arquivamento,
  observação).
- Source tracking: manual / automático / diario_oficial badges.
- Timeline visualization with author, date, type.
- CSV export per process.
- CRUD with audit logging.

DIÁRIO OFICIAL → ANDAMENTO (the key integration):
- New action "⚡ Lançar" button in intimations list (when associated
  to process).
- Single modal creates simultaneously:
  1. processMovement (source='diario_oficial', linked to intimationId)
  2. deadline (date pre-filled from regex parser of intimation text)
  3. appointment (calendar reminder 2 days before deadline)
- All three records cross-linked via intimationId and movementId.
- Intimation auto-marked as 'concluida'.
- parsePrazoFromIntimacao: regex extracts "X dias úteis|corridos".

Backward compatibility:
- showClientDetail and showProcessDetail kept as wrapper functions.
- ensureClientExtended initializes new fields lazily — old client
  records work without migration.
- Migration block adds processMovements to existing DBs.

33/33 integration checks pass. JS syntax validated. 657 lines added.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
