Substitui o backend v1 (esboço) por arquitetura de produção completa.
113 arquivos · 91 módulos Python · todos compilam.

Stack:
- Python 3.12+, FastAPI 0.115, Pydantic v2, SQLAlchemy 2.0 ASYNC (asyncpg)
- PostgreSQL 16, Redis 7, Celery 5.4 (4 filas), AWS S3 Object Lock + KMS
- httpx async, structlog, OpenTelemetry, Prometheus, Sentry

Módulos cobertos (todos os 15 do prompt):

1. Auth: OIDC (Authlib) + login local fallback + MFA TOTP + sessões
   HttpOnly/Secure/SameSite + reauth step-up via Redis.
2. PolicyEngine com 6 outcomes (allow/deny/require_approval/require_mfa/
   rate_limited/retention_blocked); persiste TODA decisão em
   policy_evaluations; ABAC sobre escopo/conector/tenant/retenção.
3. Núcleo jurídico: clients/processes/movements/deadlines/appointments/
   intimations/financial-entries — CRUD com soft delete + auditoria.
4. OSINT TACER: investigations/scopes/entities/identifiers/relations/
   connector_runs/findings/timeline_events/risk_assessments/agent_runs/
   approval_requests. 10 tipos de entidade. Hierarquia probatória
   dado_bruto → indicio → achado → evidencia_corroborada → conclusao_humana.
5. Conectores REAIS server-side: BrasilAPI (CNPJ/CEP/DDD/Bancos/Feriados),
   Transparência (CEIS/CNEP/CEPIM), DataJud, RDAP, manual_upload,
   manual_capture. Cada um com timeout/retry/circuit-breaker (purgatory)/
   cache Redis/validate_input/normalize/snapshot bruto/hash de payload.
6. Celery 4 filas (critical/default/cpu_heavy/agents) + transactional
   outbox (SKIP LOCKED). Tasks idempotentes via task_id = outbox.id.
   Workers: outbox_relay, ingest_connector, evidence_pipeline (AV/
   metadata/OCR), agents, reports, integrity, retention.
7. Cofre de evidências: S3 Object Lock GOVERNANCE (COMPLIANCE via
   ApprovalRequest dupla) + SSE-KMS + versioning + verify_integrity
   (recomputa SHA-256 a partir do S3 antes de validar) + legal_hold com
   reauth + EvidenceEvent hash-chained append-only.
8. Auditoria: AuditService append-only com chain_next, endpoint
   /audit-events/verify-chain valida segmento inteiro.
9. Agentes supervisionados (7): coleta, metadados, timeline, correlacao,
   inconsistencia, relatorio, revisao_juridica. Saída SEMPRE DRAFT com
   model_name/model_version/prompt_version/evidence_ids/limitations.
   FINAL apenas via approve_report com reauth.
10. Reports PDF (WeasyPrint) versionados; PDF final vai ao Object Lock;
    download via presigned URL TTL 60s, reauth obrigatório.
11. Security: SSRF allowlist + bloqueio IPs privados + redirect-block;
    Fernet field encryption com rotação; CSP/HSTS/X-Frame-Options
    middleware; CSRF double-submit; rate limit sliding-window por
    IP/user/tenant/connector; pii_filter no structlog redige CPF/CNPJ/
    email/JWT/tokens.
12. Observability: /health/live + /health/ready + /metrics Prometheus
    (policy_denied_total, connector_failure_total, hash_verification_total,
    legal_hold_events_total, ocr_duration_seconds) + OTel hook + Sentry.
13. Diretórios conformes spec: api/v1, core, db, models, schemas,
    repositories, services, policies, connectors, workers, evidence,
    reports, agents, audit, security, integrations.
14. Endpoints v1 completos: auth/session, auth/mfa/verify, me, clients,
    processes, deadlines, intimations, financial-entries, investigations,
    investigations/:id/entities, .../relations, osint/runs, osint/runs/:id,
    jobs/:id/events, evidences/uploads, evidences/:id/finalize, .../verify,
    .../legal-hold, agents/runs, reports, reports/:id/approve, .../download,
    audit-events, audit-events/verify-chain.
15. Qualidade: 8 arquivos de teste (unit + security + integration)
    cobrindo hash chain, pseudonimização, PII filter, MIME whitelist,
    SSRF, RBAC, PolicyEngine, audit chain. Makefile com lint/test/migrate/
    seed/run/worker/compose-up. README completo + SECURITY.md (modelo de
    ameaças + checklist de prod) + .env.example + alembic.ini.

Infra: docker-compose (Postgres/Redis/MinIO com bucket+Object Lock
auto-criado/ClamAV/API/worker/beat). Terraform skeleton (KMS + S3
Object Lock). nginx.conf de produção (TLS + rate limit + HSTS).
Dockerfiles separados api/worker (worker inclui ExifTool/qpdf/ffprobe/
OCRmyPDF/ClamAV client).

