@@ -0,0 +1,332 @@
+# Integração Claude API — SEMPER-FI
+
+**Status:** Phase 1 Completo (Foundation) | Phase 2 Iniciando (Single-Agent Integration)
+
+## Visão Geral
+
+SEMPER-FI integra Claude API como backend LLM opcional para agentes sofisticados (`relatorio`, `revisao_juridica`), mantendo agentes determinísticos (`reviewer`, `compliance`, `coordinator`) inalterados.
+
+A integração preserva:
+- **Multi-tenant isolation** via `PolicyEngine` + RLS PostgreSQL
+- **Evidence immutability** via S3 Object Lock + presigned URLs
+- **Audit trail** com hash SHA-256 chain em `claude_invocations`
+- **Cost control** com budget mensal e rate limiting
+- **Security** sem direct file uploads
+
+---
+
+## Arquitetura
+
+```
+FastAPI POST /v1/agents/runs
+  ↓
+PolicyEngine.evaluate(tenant_id, investigation_id, evidence_ids)
+  ↓
+OutboxMessage → agents queue
+  ↓
+Celery Worker: AgentRunner.run_agent_supervised_v2()
+  ├─ Check agent.model_name = "llm-premium"?
+  ├─ YES → ClaudeAgentService.run()
+  │   ├─ Load config from DB
+  │   ├─ Fetch evidence from S3
+  │   ├─ Build system prompt + context
+  │   ├─ Route: direct call vs batch
+  │   ├─ Invoke Claude (with hashing)
+  │   ├─ Persist to claude_invocations
+  │   └─ Return output + audit trail
+  ├─ NO → deterministic agent path
+  └─ Both: Update AgentRun.status + output_payload
+```
+
+---
+
+## Componentes Phase 1 ✓
+
+### Database Models (`backend/app/models/orchestration.py`)
+
+```python
+class ClaudeAgentConfiguration:
+    agent_id: str              # PK: agent name
+    tenant_id: str
+    model_id: str              # "claude-opus-4-1"
+    system_prompt: str
+    temperature: float         # 0.3 default (determinístico)
+    max_tokens: int           # 8192 default
+    structured_output_schema: JSON  # JSON Schema para modo structured output
+    file_upload_enabled: bool
+    vision_enabled: bool
+    batch_enabled: bool
+
+class ClaudeInvocation:
+    id: str
+    tenant_id: str
+    agent_run_id: str (FK)
+    model_id: str
+    request_hash: str (SHA-256)    # audit chain
+    request_tokens: int
+    response_tokens: int
+    output_hash: str (SHA-256)     # audit chain
+    cost_usd: decimal
+    status: str               # pending|success|rate_limited|error
+    previous_hash: str        # hash chain
+    current_hash: str         # hash chain
+
+class ClaudeFileReference:
+    id: str
+    claude_file_id: str (unique)  # Files API ID
+    evidence_id: str (FK)
+    agent_run_id: str (FK)
+    s3_key: str
+    expires_at: datetime      # Files API auto-deletes after 30 days
+
+class ClaudeBatchJob:
+    id: str
+    tenant_id: str
+    batch_api_id: str (unique)
+    status: str               # queued|processing|succeeded|failed
+    manifest: JSON            # num_requests, num_succeeded, etc.
+```
+
+### Service Layer (`backend/app/integrations/claude_client.py`)
+
+**ClaudeClient** — async wrapper aroundAnthropicSDK:
+- `send_message()` — invoke Claude com Structured Output opcional
+- `upload_file()` — Files API upload com tracking
+- `submit_batch()` — Batch Processing API submission
+- `get_batch_status()` — polling com exponential backoff
+- `compute_hash()` — SHA-256 canonicalization para audit
+
+### Agent Orchestration (`backend/app/agents/claude_agent.py`)
+
+**ClaudeAgentService** — supervised execution:
+- `run()` — entry point, loads config, routes call
+- `_run_direct()` — direct Claude invocation (< 100 evidence items)
+- `_run_batch()` — batch processing (≥ 100 items) [TODO]
+- `_persist_invocation()` — audit trail with hash chain
+- `_fetch_evidence()` — validates tenant isolation
+- `_build_user_message()` — context builder
+
+### Configuration (`backend/app/core/config.py` + `.env.example`)
+
+Claude settings:
+```env
+ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
+CLAUDE_ENABLED=true
+CLAUDE_DEFAULT_MODEL=claude-opus-4-1
+CLAUDE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=300
+CLAUDE_BATCH_ENABLED=false
+CLAUDE_RATE_LIMIT_RPM=100
+CLAUDE_MONTHLY_BUDGET_USD=5000.0
+CLAUDE_SOFT_LIMIT_PCT=80.0
+CLAUDE_FILES_API_ENABLED=true
+CLAUDE_VISION_ENABLED=true
+```
+
+### Database Migration
+
+Alembic 0003: cria tabelas claude_* + coluna evidence_events.claude_invocation_id
+
+---
+
+## Phase 2: Single-Agent Integration (Próxima)
+
+### Tarefas
+
+1. **Modify Agent Runner** (`backend/app/workers/tasks/agents.py`)
+   - Route based on agent config:
+     ```python
+     if use_claude and spec.model_name == "llm-premium":
+         service = ClaudeAgentService(session, agent_run_id)
+         result = await service.run()
+     else:
+         result = await deterministic_agent(...)
+     ```
+
+2. **Update Agent Registry** (`backend/app/agents/registry.py`)
+   - Mark agents as LLM-capable:
+     ```python
+     registry["relatorio"] = AgentSpec(
+         ...
+         model_name="llm-premium",
+     )
+     ```
+
+3. **Create Claude Config Seeding**
+   - Seed table com configs padrão (per agent + tenant)
+   - Via Alembic data migration
+
+4. **Implement Output Validation**
+   - Integrate with existing `reviewer` agent
+   - Validate against forbidden patterns (URLs, SSNs, tokens)
+   - Manual approval for low-confidence outputs
+
+5. **Unit Tests**
+   - `test_claude_client.py`: message, file upload, hashing
+   - `test_claude_agent.py`: evidence fetch, routing, audit
+   - Mock Anthropic responses
+
+---
+
+## Segurança
+
+### Multi-Tenant Isolation
+
+```python
+# PolicyEngine checks before invocation:
+await policy_engine.evaluate({
+    "action": "agent.run",
+    "resource": "investigation",
+    "resource_id": investigation_id,
+    "tenant_id": tenant_id,
+    "actor": current_user,
+})
+
+# ClaudeAgentService enforces:
+evidence = await fetch_evidence_for_tenant(
+    evidence_ids,
+    investigation_id,
+    tenant_id  # ← filter
+)
+```
+
+### Audit Trail: Hash Chain
+
+```
+Request:
+  request_hash = SHA256(canonical_json(request))
+
+Response:
+  output_hash = SHA256(canonical_json(output))
+
+Chain:
+  previous_invocation.current_hash → new_invocation.previous_hash
+  current_hash = SHA256({"request": request_hash, "output": output_hash, "previous": previous_hash})
+
+Verification:
+  for each invocation:
+    current_hash == SHA256({"request": ..., "output": ..., "previous": invocation[i-1].current_hash})
+```
+
+### File Handling: No Direct Uploads
+
+✗ Bad: User → FastAPI → Claude API  
+✓ Good: User → FastAPI → S3 (Object Lock) → Claude (Files API) → audit trail
+
+```python
+# Worker downloads from S3, verifies SHA-256
+evidence = await vault.get(evidence_id)
+if evidence.sha256_verified:
+    # Upload to Claude Files API (if needed)
+    file_ref = await client.upload_file(evidence.data, evidence.mime_type)
+    
+    # Store reference in DB
+    db.add(ClaudeFileReference(
+        claude_file_id=file_ref["file_id"],
+        evidence_id=evidence_id,
+        s3_key=evidence.s3_key,
+        expires_at=file_ref["expires_at"],
+    ))
+```
+
+### Cost Control
+
+```python
+# Soft limit (80%):
+if monthly_spend > budget * 0.8:
+    alert("Claude spend 80% of budget")
+
+# Hard limit (100%):
+if monthly_spend >= budget:
+    policy_decision = PolicyDecision.RATE_LIMITED
+    return {"status": "rate_limited", "error": "Monthly budget exceeded"}
+```
+
+---
+
+## Integração com Existentes
+
+### Reviewer Agent (`backend/app/agents/reviewer.py`)
+
+Executa após Claude retorna (DRAFT → REVIEWING):
+- Valida structure (JSON schema match)
+- Bloqueia forbidden patterns
+- Computa confidence score
+- Recomenda manual approval (confidence < 0.7)
+
+### Audit Service (`backend/app/audit/service.py`)
+
+Log cada invocation:
+```python
+await audit_service.write(
+    action="claude.invoke",
+    resource="agent_run",
+    resource_id=agent_run_id,
+    tenant_id=tenant_id,
+    metadata={
+        "model": config.model_id,
+        "tokens_in": response.usage.input_tokens,
+        "tokens_out": response.usage.output_tokens,
+        "cost_usd": cost,
+        "invocation_id": invocation.id,
+    },
+)
+```
+
+---
+
+## Desenvolvimento Local
+
+### Setup
+
+```bash
+# Install anthropic
+pip install anthropic>=0.30.0
+
+# Add API key to .env
+ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here
+CLAUDE_ENABLED=true
+
+# Run migrations
+alembic upgrade head
+```
+
+### Testing
+
+```bash
+# Unit tests (mocked Claude)
+pytest tests/integrations/test_claude_client.py -v
+
+# Integration tests (real Claude API)
+pytest tests/agents/test_claude_agent.py -v -m integration
+```
+
+---
+
+## Próximas Fases
+
+### Phase 3: Features (Weeks 4-5)
+- Vision API para PDFs/imagens
+- Files API com caching
+- Batch Processing (1000+ items)
+- Dashboard de custo
+
+### Phase 4: Compliance & Hardening (Week 6)
+- Policy engine integration
+- Cost dashboard endpoint
+- Security review + penetration testing
+- Performance benchmarks
+
+### Phase 5: Migration & Go-Live (Week 7)
+- Migrate existing "llm-premium" stubs
+- Canary testing (10% → 100%)
+- Runbooks + operator training
+- Monitor error rates, tokens, costs
+
+---
+
+## Links
+
