+## 2. Fluxo de Dados: Evidência → Claude → Relatório
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    actor User
+    participant Frontend as 🎨 semperfi.html<br/>Vue 3
+    participant FastAPI as 🐍 FastAPI<br/>Backend
+    participant PolicyEngine as 🛡️ PolicyEngine
+    participant Celery as 🔄 Celery<br/>Worker
+    participant VaultService as 📁 Vault<br/>S3 Object Lock
+    participant Claude as 🧠 Claude API<br/>Files/Batch
+    participant PostgreSQL as 🗄️ PostgreSQL<br/>Hash Chain
+    participant Reviewer as 👁️ Reviewer<br/>Agent
+    
+    User->>Frontend: 1️⃣ Upload PDF + Iniciar Investigação
+    Frontend->>FastAPI: POST /v1/evidence/upload
+    FastAPI->>PolicyEngine: Validate tenant + permissions
+    PolicyEngine->>VaultService: Store in S3 Object Lock + KMS
+    VaultService->>PostgreSQL: Create EvidenceEvent (hash chain)
+    PostgreSQL-->>FastAPI: OK + evidence_id
+    
+    User->>Frontend: 2️⃣ Solicitar análise Claude
+    Frontend->>FastAPI: POST /v1/agents/runs<br/>agent_id=revisao_juridica
+    FastAPI->>PolicyEngine: Check investigation access + cost budget
+    PolicyEngine->>Celery: Enqueue task (agents queue)
+    Celery-->>FastAPI: OK + agent_run_id
+    
+    Celery->>VaultService: 3️⃣ Fetch evidence from S3<br/>Verify SHA-256
+    VaultService-->>Celery: Evidence bytes
+    
+    Celery->>Claude: 4️⃣ Upload to Files API<br/>+ system_prompt + context
+    Claude-->>Celery: file_id + usage tokens
+    Celery->>PostgreSQL: Store ClaudeFileReference
+    
+    Celery->>Claude: 5️⃣ invoke message()<br/>model=claude-opus-4-1
+    Claude-->>Celery: response.content (JSON)<br/>+ usage.input_tokens<br/>+ usage.output_tokens
+    
+    Celery->>PostgreSQL: 6️⃣ Persist ClaudeInvocation<br/>request_hash + output_hash<br/>previous_hash → current_hash
+    PostgreSQL-->>Celery: invocation_id
+    
+    Celery->>Reviewer: 7️⃣ Validate output<br/>Check forbidden patterns<br/>Compute confidence
+    Reviewer-->>Celery: review_decision<br/>+ score
+    
+    Celery->>PostgreSQL: 8️⃣ Update AgentRun<br/>status=DRAFT<br/>output_payload
+    Celery->>PostgreSQL: Write AuditEvent<br/>action=claude.invoke
+    
+    Celery-->>FastAPI: Return result
+    FastAPI-->>Frontend: Show draft report + confidence
+    
+    User->>Frontend: 9️⃣ Aprovação manual (se needed)
+    Frontend->>FastAPI: POST /v1/agents/runs/{id}/approve
+    FastAPI->>PostgreSQL: Update status=APPROVED
+    FastAPI->>VaultService: Generate PDF + sign
+    
+    FastAPI-->>Frontend: 🔟 Final report + audit trail
+    Frontend-->>User: Download + view audit chain
+```
