+| **AWS S3** | `EvidenceVault` + boto3 | Object Lock, versioning, KMS encryption | Evidence storage imutável | ✅ Production |
+| **AWS KMS** | Envelope encryption | Key rotation, DEK/KEK isolation | Criptografia in transit + at rest | ✅ Production |
+| **AWS ECS** | Terraform + GitHub Actions | Container orchestration, auto-scaling | Deploy production | ✅ Production |
+| **AWS Secrets Manager** | `secrets.py` integration | API keys, rotation, audit | Secret storage seguro | ✅ Production |
+| **AWS CloudWatch** | Structlog + boto3 | Logs centralizados, métricas, alarms | Observabilidade | ✅ Production |
+| **PostgreSQL 16** | SQLAlchemy async + RLS | Multi-tenant isolation, append-only audit | Dados + compliance | ✅ Production |
+| **Redis 7** | Celery broker + cache | Task queue, session store | Background jobs | ✅ Production |
+| **Celery 5** | 4 queues dedicated | Agent orchestration, parallelization | Processamento assíncrono | ✅ Production |
+| **FastAPI 0.115** | Async handlers | HTTP API, request routing | Integração central | ✅ Production |
+| **Terraform** | IaC modules | Infrastructure provisioning | AWS setup automático | ✅ Phase 5 |
+| **GitHub Actions** | CI/CD workflows | lint, test, build, deploy | Automação end-to-end | ✅ Phase 5 |
+| **VS Code Dev Container** | Dockerfile + compose | Local dev environment | Onboarding developers | ✅ Complete |
+| **BrasilAPI** | httpx connector | CNPJ/CPF lookup | Entity resolution | ✅ Production |
+| **DataJud** | httpx connector | Judicial data from CNJ | Case research | ✅ Production |
+| **Portal Transparência** | httpx connector | Government spending data | Investigation context | ✅ Production |
+| **OSINT Sources** | httpx + parsing | News, WHOIS, public registers | Background research | ✅ Phase 2 |
